        ; Find-first and find-next then share a tail.  AH is set at 3E9Fh or 3EEAh and
        ; FOR_DO_FIND does the rest, so the difference between starting an expansion and
        ; continuing one is a register, not a code path.  CX comes from FOR_SEARCH_ATTR,
        ; which is #1136's /S bit spelled as an attribute.
