CMD_GOTO:
        ; Rewind to the top and read forward for a `:label`, 8 chars deep
        ; Outside a batch file GOTO does nothing and says nothing -- 5A31h tests
        ; SHELL_BATCH_ACTIVE and 5A38h just returns.
