        ; A sweep for any ten bytes appearing twice in the code finds sixteen more pairs
        ; and every one is already accounted for: the two SAVE_CONTEXT copies (#982), the
        ; two upcase copies (#1256), PB_FIND_ATTR beside PB_PATH_EXISTS (#1212),
        ; IF_PARSE_COMPARISON beside IF_ASK_AND_COMPARE (#1213), the four string copiers
        ; (#1219), and the shared "clear the low SHELL_FLAGS bits and record it" tail at
        ; six error exits.
