        ; The buffer out in 64K pieces, with the Ctrl-Z decision at the end
        ; The buffer goes out in two parts.  COPY_BUF_SIZE_HI counts whole 64K blocks and
        ; each pass writes 0FFFFh bytes and steps the segment:
